    "body": "Merged main to resolve conflicts (`crates/app/tests/level_links.rs`: keep both sides). New head: 8072cce76.\n\nConflict:\n- This PR split `a_helix_under_the_bore_floor_is_never_silent` into the helper `never_under_the_bore_floor` and 4 cases (`helix`, `plunge`, `ramp`, `arc`).\n- PR #1780 (#1774) changed the same test. It added the helper `to_tri` and replaced the \"nothing below Z 0\" assert with a footprint-distance assert (every move below Z 0 is at least 5.0 - 0.02 from the part's projected facets).\n\nResolution:\n- The split stays: 1 helper and 4 cases.\n- The helper now has the #1780 assertions: it reads the world `w`, gets the part facets, and asserts the footprint distance. The old `low >= -1e-6` assert is removed, as #1780 removed it.\n- `to_tri` is added above the doc comment of the test, so that the doc comment stays on the helper.\n- `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only the 5 test files of this PR.\n\nReadings (targeted gate, `cargo xtask gate test`, `-j 6`):\n- `camcraft-app` `level_links`: 25 passed, 0 failed (`#[test]` count 25, not changed).\n- `camcraft-app` `keep_law`: 31 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --test level_links --test keep_law -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n`cargo xtask merge-plan --delta 1838 --reviewed da5862cd3`: DELTA (8072cce7, hand-resolved: `crates/app/tests/level_links.rs`). A delta review of `git show --remerge-diff 8072cce76` is necessary. The `merge-ready` label is removed. The PR stays a draft.\n\nReady for a re-check (/resolve-conflicts check).\n",
